  "cuisine": "new-openings",
  "note": "THE NEW-OPENINGS PASS. Not a cuisine - a recency cross-check, and structurally necessary. Every other pass in this project ranks by CONSENSUS across published lists, which means a restaurant needs months of coverage before it can score. A place that opened this year is therefore invisible to all of them by construction, no matter how good it is. Oudh 1722 is the worked example: Aktar Islam's Awadhi restaurant opened in spring 2026 and reached the sheet only because it had been parked in pending since the Italian pass, not because any cuisine pass found it. SCORING NOTE: the 2+ domain threshold used elsewhere is deliberately relaxed in reading this pass - a genuinely new opening may only have one or two write-ups, so the single-domain tier is worth reading here in a way it is not for established cuisines. Every URL came from a search result.",
